"The cataclysm was a ritual cast under the Great Ziggurat by Semeryss of Leki, the Arcane Advisor."
"The cataclysm ritual syphoned all mana from Old Harrak and killed about a million people."
"A hidden Old Harrak golem foundry in the deadlands holds stores of silverite, copper and bronze."
"Abenezigel once lived unhappily in the hidden golem foundry; he now leads a secret project there."
"Old Harrak holds a vast reserve of black necrarch cores, which Harrak mines for shield power."
